[SIZE="4"][B]Useful validation commands:[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]adb logcat
adb shell getprop gsm.sim.state
adb shell getprop gsm.version.baseband
adb shell getprop wlan.driver.status
adb shell ls /sys/class/bluetooth
adb shell dumpsys connectivity | grep -A3 "Tether state"
adb shell cat /proc/meminfo[/CODE]

