[SIZE="4"][B]Changelog:[/B][/SIZE]

[B]PUT_BUILD_DATE_HERE[/B]
[LIST]
[*]First CM10 build, with all the CM9 work ported: RIL translation, Wi-Fi driver built from source, GPS, software JPEG camera, Wi-Fi hotspot, zram, Claro Peru APNs
[*][B]Bluetooth fixed:[/B] the chip is now started with the right (Qualcomm) firmware loader
[*][B]Microphone fixed:[/B] recordings in 3GP/AMR were rejected by the Jelly Bean audio policy
[*][B]Camera fixed:[/B] photos are taken at the largest size the camera really delivers (1600x1200); bigger sizes produced empty or striped images
[*][B]Wi-Fi hotspot fixed for Jelly Bean[/B]
[*][B]GPS:[/B] fixed a crash loading the location module that caused a bootloop
[*][B]Space:[/B] unused keyboard dictionaries (all except English and Spanish), tablet wallpapers, theme engine and Exchange removed so the system fits in the partition
[/LIST]

